  "content": "\n\n![TMML Logo](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Foxirion/Transport-Module-Modular-Logistics/refs/heads/1.21-neo/src/main/resources/TMML_title.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tmml\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tmml\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tmml\"><img alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1133923?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=1B3193\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tmml\"><img alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/7Bs4lCxX?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=1B3193\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://x.com/s_forge31658\"><img alt=\"X（原 Twitter）網址\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/url?url=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fs_forge31658&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=000000&label=追蹤我&color=555555\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Foxirion/Transport-Module-Modular-Logistics/issues\"><img alt=\"GitHub 問題回報\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Foxirion/Transport-Module-Modular-Logistics?style=for-the-badge&color=1B3193\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Foxirion/Transport-Module-Modular-Logistics/blob/1.21-neo/LICENSE.txt\"><img alt=\"GitHub 授權條款\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/Foxirion/Transport-Module-Modular-Logistics?style=for-the-badge&color=1B3193\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://starexify.github.io/FnB-Projects/src/\"><img alt=\"F&B 專案中心\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Starexify/Starexify/b79e6e8e9e0772de98a4584e41476894a655ac0c/resources/Minecraft/Desc/site/cozy_vector.svg\"></a>\n</p>\n\n\n## ℹ️ 關於\n\n透過「運輸模組：模組化物流」簡化您的物流作業。\n輕鬆運輸箱子、刷怪籠、潛影盒等關鍵方塊及其他物品。\n我的模組化系統提供靈活且高效的運輸解決方案。\n\n## ✨ 功能特色\n\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left; border: none;\"><strong>🫙 虛空瓶</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left; border: none;\">從終界傳送門或通道收集少量虛空能量，製作屬於自己的微型黑洞，可用於製作運輸模組。</td>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left; border: none;\"><strong>💾 運輸模組</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left; border: none;\">探索這些實用道具，內含微型黑洞可儲存大量方塊、流體與實體，讓運輸更加輕鬆。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n## 🗓️ 預計更新\n\n  **_即將推出功能：_**\n  - 目前暫無重大規劃\n\n## 📜 授權條款\n\n本模組採用 MIT 授權條款，允許免費使用、修改與分發，代表您可以在您的整合包中使用此模組。如需更多詳細資訊，請參閱隨附的完整授權文件。",
